38 Section 1. Section 17B-1-102 is amended to read:
39 17B-1-102. Definitions.
As used in this title:
41 (1) "Appointing authority" means the person or body authorized to make an appointment to the board of
trustees.
43 (2) "Basic special district":
44 (a) means a special district that is not a specialized special district; and
45
